{"title": "Longstrider", "pageid": 2253, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Longstrider", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Transmutation spells", "Ritual spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Longstrider.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Longstrider.webp/300px-Longstrider.webp, /w/images/1/1b/Longstrider.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Longstrider.webp/300px-Longstrider.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Longstrider.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Longstrider </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 transmutation spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to make a creature move farther during a turn.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nIncrease a creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> by 3 m (10 ft).<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/38px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\">Ritual</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Upcasting\" title=\"Upcasting\">Upcasting</a>: Affect an additional target for each spell slot level above 1st.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Longstrider</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Longstrider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Longstrider\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnorePreviouslyPickedEntities_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnorePreviouslyPickedEntities (spell flag)\">IgnorePreviouslyPickedEntities</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Longstrider\"> Condition: Longstrider </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Longstrider_(Condition)\" title=\"Longstrider (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Longstrider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Longstrider_(Condition)\" title=\"Longstrider (Condition)\">Longstrider</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Increase a creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> by 3 m (10 ft).</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li><li> Class level 2: <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a></li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Bard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Bard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\">Magic Initiate: Bard</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\">Magic Initiate: Druid</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\">Magic Initiate: Wizard</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster:_Free_Spells\" title=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/38px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/50px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster:_Free_Spells\" title=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\">Ritual Caster: Free Spells</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blackguard%27s_Greaves\" title=\"Blackguard's Greaves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Boots_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blackguard%27s_Greaves\" title=\"Blackguard's Greaves\">Blackguard's Greaves</a></span> </li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Persistence\" title=\"Boots of Persistence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Boots_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Persistence\" title=\"Boots of Persistence\">Boots of Persistence</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>As this is a ritual spell, it is free to cast outside of combat and persists on all recipients (even in not in the active party) until death or a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. As such, if having someone in the party who can cast this spell, it is advisable to have it active all party members at all times.\n<ul><li>If cast by a <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">druid</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard</a>, this spell must remain <a href=\"/wiki/Prepared_spells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prepared spells\">prepared</a> by the party member who cast it; removing it from the caster's Prepared Spells list immediately removes the buff from all party members whom the caster applied it to.</li></ul></li>\n<li>This is the only ritual spell in Baldur's Gate 3 which has upcasting benefits; the game allows selecting a higher level spell slot when ritual casting this spell out of combat, though all this does is apply the effect to multiple targets in a single casting.</li>\n<li>The incantations for Longstrider are <b>Properō</b>, the Latin command <i>\"Hasten!\"</i>, <b>Citium</b>, Latin for <i>\"Quick\"</i>, and <b>Ocior</b>, for <i>\"Faster\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715114945\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.091 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4345/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64178/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22256/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.037/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1637575/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n109.43%   91.019     51 Template:Trim\n100.00%   83.179      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   83.179      1 -total\n 13.74%   11.432      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 13.68%   11.381      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 13.54%   11.258      7 Template:Icon_text\n 11.37%    9.455      2 Template:Item_icon\n 10.94%    9.102      6 Template:Icon_link\n  9.31%    7.743      1 Template:Condition\n  9.14%    7.603      1 Template:Resource\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:2253-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715114945 and revision id 374768. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}